{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10297670","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10297670","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1029767001:1":{"text":"Oh? What brings you here? Look how busy this place has become.","source_cn":"噢？你们怎么来了？看，这里变得多么热闹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31C0D8F3079A050F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1029767002:1":{"text":"And lots of good stuff, too. I even ordered a new weapon the other day.","source_cn":"而且有不少好东西，我这两天都忍不住下了新武器的订单。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF42C35866D144063","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1029767002":{"text":"And lots of good stuff, too. I even ordered a new weapon the other day.","source_cn":"而且有不少好东西，我这两天都忍不住下了新武器的订单。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF42C35866D144063","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029767003:1":{"text":"Direct trade with Cedartown? That sounds promising indeed. Alsa would finally catch a break.","source_cn":"直接与雪松镇进行贸易？这太棒了，如果能实行，阿尔萨那孩...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDF7EEC37D024460","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029767004:1":{"text":"She's running into trouble?","source_cn":"她在经营上遇到什么难题了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49E0C9BBEBD03340","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029767005:1":{"text":"Quite. There's far too much paperwork involved with passing through Holistone, resulting in constant delays.","source_cn":"和你们刚刚讲的雪松镇遇到的问题一样，货物通过圣石镇中转...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x847F49B8A832C031","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029767006:1":{"text":"Hmm. Cedartown is used to handling tourists, so they're at least efficient with the paperwork. But Holistone...","source_cn":"唔，雪松镇毕竟是公国，也习惯于接待游客了，各种手续都会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4CB771EB864F5D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029767007:1":{"text":"And Alsa's handling everything here on her own. Guess I didn't think this through.","source_cn":"蛮血这边就靠阿尔萨来组织……唔，确实是我此前思虑不周了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68453FCF60FBC321","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1029767008:1":{"text":"I'll pull more people to help out with the operations here.","source_cn":"我会尽快调拨更多人手，来协助贵方运营的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66060CFEE72473C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1029767009:1":{"text":"Hahaha, that will be great. Tough conditions build character, and Alsa's grown a lot recently.","source_cn":"哈哈哈，那就再好不过，虽说越是艰苦的环境越能锻炼人，阿...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16ACCB6B5C09A451","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1029767010:1":{"text":"But if she keeps going like this, I'm worried she'll collapse from overwork.","source_cn":"但再这么成长下去，我都担心她会不会哪天累倒在岗位上。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FC5FE06A2529753","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1029767011:1":{"text":"If she gets a break, she can travel more—she's been jealous of Lumont lately.","source_cn":"如果能有人轮换，她也能到处去玩玩了——这些天她可是一直...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C3F8F1EE0D01471","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1029767012:0":{"text":"Lumont went to Holistone! Huge place!","source_cn":"我去了圣石镇！可大啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53EAB81028A79A03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1029767013:0":{"text":"We all rode with Soren!","source_cn":"和大家一起，坐索恩的车！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4A669314F141D38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:19:1029767013":{"text":"We all rode with Soren!","source_cn":"和大家一起，坐索恩的车！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4A669314F141D38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1029767014:0":{"text":"Yes! The bread was tasty, and the statue was beautiful!","source_cn":"开心！面包特别好吃！雕像也好看！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB974599335A414D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1029767016:0":{"text":"He's been wanting to see new places for a while. After tagging along to Holistone, he's been drawing nonstop.","source_cn":"这孩子一直想去不同的地方，上次跟车去了一次圣石镇，这几...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B894D927EE86647","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1029767017:1":{"text":"Lumont, would you like to visit Cedartown? That's where all these blades were made.","source_cn":"噜噜，想不想去雪松镇玩？看，就是这些刀剑铸造出来的地方。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D86FB6A246781BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1029767018:1":{"text":"Cedartown... Will there be snow?","source_cn":"雪松镇……能去看雪吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60FD1E9C43D9B763","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1029767019:1":{"text":"Of course! I heard the snow there is something else, not just the light dusting we see here in the desert when it snows.","source_cn":"当然，据说那里到处都是雪，比沙漠里的小雪花可有意思多了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE92BC8C4041DF5E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1029767020:1":{"text":"Lumont's never seen real snow!","source_cn":"噜噜还没有，看过大雪！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F3E8FC40AB4E08C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1029767021:1":{"text":"Lumont bought a bunch of new paints to draw many new things with!","source_cn":"我买了很多新的颜料，可以画很多新的画！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34AC17F8247C03D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1029767022:1":{"text":"Hahaha, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> and Rowan—looks like we're all ready to go.","source_cn":"哈哈哈，<style=stress><player_n...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x20AD21D269B6A9D9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Hahaha, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> and Rowan—looks like we're all ready to go.","female":"Hahaha, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> and Rowan—looks like we're all ready to go.","variant_male_record_index":"103019","variant_female_record_index":"103020","document_title":"","documen